<title>USA: Oscar nominees for best supporting actor.</title>
<headline>Oscar nominees for best supporting actor.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The actors nominated on Tuesday for the Academy Award for best supporting actor were Cuba Gooding Jr. &quot;Jerry Maguire&quot;, William H. Macy &quot;Fargo&quot;, Armin Mueller-Stahl &quot;Shine&quot;, Edward Norton &quot;Primal Fear&quot;, and James Woods &quot;Ghosts of Mississippi&quot;.</p>
</text>
